      "description": "View and manage workflows in Campaigner  \n"
    },
    {
      "name": "apiresponsecodes",
      "x-displayName": "API Response Codes",
      "description": "This page lists all the response codes returned by the Campaigner REST API, along with their messages and possible causes.\n\n| **HTTP Response Code**      | **Response Code** | **Possible Cause**                                                                                                  |\n|-----------------------------|-------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| 429 Too Many Requests       | 1                 | Account has exceeded the API rate limit. Check the response header to understand when to place next API calls without hitting the rate limiting              |\n| 403 Forbidden               | 2                 | Account is currently not active                                                                                     |\n| 403 Forbidden               | 3                 | Account is currently blocked from sending {channel} specific messages                                               |\n| 405 Method Not Allowed      | 4                 | When a specific HTTP POST/PUT/DELETE/GET is not permitted                                                           |\n| 403 Forbidden               | 5                 | The account is not authorized to make this API call                                                                 |\n| 403 Forbidden               | 6                 | The account for which the integration key is used to authenticate this API call cannot make API calls on the account id specified in X-Account-Id header                                                         |\n| 403 Forbidden               | 7                 | Integration key is inactive or unrecognized                                                                         |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 8                 | PageSize exceeds the maximum value allowed                                                                          |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 9                 | API call is missing the required pagination parameters\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t|\n| 400 Bad Request             | 10                | Invalid value for pagination sorting. Provide value as: asc or desc                                                 |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 11                | File is inaccessible or not found                                                                                   |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 12                | File is blank                                                                                                       |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 13                | Limit defined for a specific resource or asset has reached                                                          |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 14                | File type not allowed                                                                                               |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 15                | There was an error while uploading the file. Please try again later                                                 |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 16                | A specific feature required for this API call is not enabled on the account                                         |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 50                | The API request has some unsupported parameters                                                                     |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 60                | Request execution is partially successful. Please refer to response_details for more information.                   |\n| 409 Conflict                | 70                | The requested resource is currently in use and hence cannot be accessed or updated                                  |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 102               | The value already exists                                                                                            |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 103               | The URL supplied is unreachable                                                                                     |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 104               | The specified parameter exceeds allowed character limit                                                             |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 105               | The supplied content fails the validation checks                                                                    |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 106               | Invalid Search XML\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t|\n| 400 Bad Request             | 107               | The API request is missing a required parameter                                                                     |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 108               | Value supplied for a field is blank. Please supply a non-blank value for that field                                 |\n| 400 Bad Request OR 404 Not Found | 109          | The id supplied does not exist or is invalid                                                                        |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 110               | The operator value supplied is invalid                                                                              |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 111               | The value supplied in the request is invalid                                                                        |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 112               | The account has reached the maximum allowed limit for this resource/entity                                          |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 113               | Repetition of element not allowed                                                                                   |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 114               | Missing values for 'between' operator\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t|\n| 400 Bad Request             | 115               | Invalid value order for 'between' operator\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t|\n| 400 Bad Request             | 116               | The API requests to delete entities more than maximum allowed in a single API request                               |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 117               | Invalid value supplied for a parameter. Please refer to response_details for acceptable values                      |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 118               | Root category already exists                                                                                        |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 119               | API request failed for unknown reasons. Please try again later                                                      |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 120               | Invalid request. There is nothing to update                                                                         |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 121               | Invalid parameter name                                                                                              |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 122               | The requested resource cannot be deleted                                                                            |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 123               | The API request is missing the contact primary key value                                                            |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 124               | The URL supplied in the API request contains spaces. Please remove those spaces and retry                           |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 125               | The API request is missing the email address for the contact                                                        |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 126               | The requested resource is not in an appropriate status and hence cannot be updated                                  |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 127               | Missing or invalid parameter                                                                                        |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 1001              | Account is not authorized to resubscribe contacts\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t|\n| 400 Bad Request             | 1002              | Cannot send email to requested contact. The contact email status is not subscribed or soft-bouned                   |\n| 400 Bad Request             | 1006              | The API request has an array parameter specified with no elements                                                   |"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/account/v1/subaccount": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "accountsv1subaccount",
        "tags": [
          "accounts"
        ],
        "summary": "Create A New Subaccount - BETA",
        "description": "This API call allows you to create a new child account under your own Campaigner account. ",
        "security": [
          {
            "IntegrationKey": []
          }
        ],
        "x-codeSamples": [
          {
            "lang": "curl",
            "source": "curl -X POST \\\n  https://api.campaigner.com/account/v1/subaccount \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -H 'IntegrationKey: YOUR_API_KEY_HERE' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"companyName\": \"GBC\",\n    \"title\": \"test title\",\n    \"firstName\": \"first\",\n    \"lastname\": \"last\",\n    \"email\": \"test2@xyz.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"6135551234\",\n    \"fax\": \"6135554321\",\n    \"timeZoneId\": 901,\n    \"userName\": \"testname2\",\n    \"password\": \"testpassword\",\n    \"securityQuestionType\": \"BIRTH_CITY\",\n    \"securityQuestionAnswer\": \"Brockville\",\n    \"url\": \"http://google.ca\",\n    \"disableGuiAccess\": false,\n    \"address\": {\n        \"line1\": \"123 here street\",\n        \"line2\": \"Apr B\",\n        \"city\": \"Anytown\",\n        \"state\": \"ON\",\n        \"zip\": \"H0EH0E\",\n        \"country\": \"Canada\"\n    },\n    \"sendPasswordByEmail\": false    \n}'"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateSubaccountModel"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Response recieved from interla provisioning system",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateSubaccountResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "You are not authorized to make API request for account id",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "response_code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "format": "int32",
                      "readOnly": true
                    },
                    "response_message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "response_details": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "example": {
                    "responseCode": 6,
                    "responseDetails": "You are not authorized to make API request for account id: 123456789",
                    "responseMessage": "Account is not setup for creating sub accounts."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/auth/v1/integration": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "authv1integration",
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Create A New Integration Key",
        "description": "This API call allows you to create a new integration key for your own Campaigner account. ",
        "security": [
          {
            "IntegrationKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XAccountId"
          }
        ],
        "x-codeSamples": [
          {
            "lang": "curl",
            "source": "curl -X POST \\\n  https://api.campaigner.com/auth/v1/integration \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -H 'IntegrationKey: YOUR_API_KEY_HERE' \\\n  -H 'X-Account-Id: 123456' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"description\": \"Integration key for API calls\",\n    \"isActive\": true\n  }'\n"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IntegrationKeyCreateModel"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Key creation is successful",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IntegrationKeysResponseResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Description is more than 4000 characters",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError_CharactersLimit"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Integration Key supplied for the API call with any Campaigner account",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError_InvalidIntegrationKey"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Account is not active",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError_InactiveAccount"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many requests",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorRateLimitExceeded"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal error while processing the request",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError_UnknownApiError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sms/v1/send/single": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "smsv1sendsingle",
        "tags": [
          "sms"
        ],
        "summary": "Send a single SMS",
        "description": "Send a single SMS message to a mobile phone number. The message can be up to 4000 characters long.",
        "security": [
          {
            "IntegrationKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XAccountId"
          }
        ],
        "x-codeSamples": [
          {
            "lang": "curl",
            "source": "curl -X POST \\\n  https://api.campaigner.com/sms/v1/send/single \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -H 'IntegrationKey: YOUR_API_KEY_HERE' \\\n  -H 'X-Account-Id: 123456' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"mobilePhone\": \"19998887770\",\n    \"messageContent\": \"Hey, there!\",\n    \"shortenURLs\": true,\n    \"customHeaders\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"custom header name\",\n        \"value\": \"custom header value\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"includeUnsubscribeMessage\": true\n  }'\n"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "JSON object containing the details of the SMS message to send.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SingleSmsMessageRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "SMS send successful",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SingleSMSMessageSendResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request due to several potential reasons:\n- Account has SMS enabled but has not completed number set up\n- Mobile Phone field is empty or not present or is invalid or more than 15 characters long\n- Mobile Phone is out of account's sending region or globally blacklisted\n- Content is empty or not present or invalid or more than 4000 characters or contains invalid characters\n- Custom headers are invalid or name and/or value is not specified\n- There are more than 5 custom headers or character length for name and/or value exceeds 255\n",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid integration key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Unauthorized due to several potential reasons:\n- Account is inactive\n- Integration key is invalid or inactive\n- Account does not have SMS enabled\n- SMS volume sending limit and/or account credit limit has reached\n- Subaccount is inactive or is not under the master account with integration key\n",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many requests",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorRateLimitExceeded"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal error while processing the request",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sms/v1/campaign": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "smsv1campaign",
        "tags": [
          "sms"
        ],
        "summary": "Create an SMS campaign",
        "description": "Create an SMS campaign and returns the id of the created SMS campaign.",
        "security": [
          {
            "IntegrationKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XAccountId"
          }
        ],
        "x-codeSamples": [
          {
            "lang": "curl",
            "source": "curl -X POST \\\n  https://api.campaigner.com/sms/v1/campaign \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -H 'IntegrationKey: YOUR_API_KEY_HERE' \\\n  -H 'X-Account-Id: 123456' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"name\": \"SMS campaign name\",\n    \"isWorkflowCampaign\": false,\n    \"shortenURLs\": false,\n    \"trackAllLinkClicks\": false,\n    \"sendFrom\": \"sender 123\",\n    \"includeUnsubscribeMessage\": true,\n    \"contents\": {\n      \"contentSourceType\": \"Campaign or Custom\",\n      \"messageContent\": \"This is my SMS campaign.\",\n      \"campaignId\": 123\n    },\n    \"deliveryNotificationEmailAddresses\": [\n      \"email-1@example.com\",\n      \"email-2@example.com\"\n    ]\n  }'\n"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "Create SMS campaign request body format.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateSmsCampaignModel"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Create SMS campaign successful",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateSmsCampaignModelResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request due to several potential reasons:\n- Campaign name that already exists on the requested account\n- User supplies a campaign name having invalid characters\n- User supplies a blank campaign name\n- User supplies a campaign name having more than 255 characters\n- Request has invalid value, blank value or no value specified for contentSourceType\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and has no messageContent node specified\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and messageContent node specified with invalid value\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and messageContent node specified exceeding 4000 character limit\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and messageContent node specified has invalid characters\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and messageContent node specified has invalid merge fields\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Campaign and has no campaignId node specified\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Campaign and campaignId node specified with blank/null value\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Campaign and campaignId node specified with invalid value (not existing SMS campaign or not an SMS campaign or does not belong to this account)\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to campaign and campaignId node specified with a valid value BUT the campaign contents contain invalid value (as per existing content checks performed on the UI)\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Campaign and campaignId node specified has valid value BUT the campaign contents have invalid merge fields\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to campaign and campaignId node specified with a valid value BUT the campaign contents contain invalid characters\n- The API will validate the email addresses supplied for their format, and will respond with an error in case the email address(s) supplied are not in valid format\n- API will respond with an error in case user provides more than 5 email addresses for delivery notification\n- If the value supplied for sendFrom does not exist as a valid configured value for Sender Name for the account/API space for which this SMS campaign is being created\n- If the API has a blank/null value specified for sendFrom field\n- If the API request has contents node specified without null/blank value set for it, but has no contentSourceType node specified \n- If account is not enabled with workflows feature and API has isworkflowcampaign parameter set to true\n",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "Campaign name already exists": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 102,
                      "response_message": "SMS Campaign 1 already exists",
                      "response_details": "Another SMS campaign with SMS Campaign 1 already exists on the account. Please specify another unique value for: name"
                    }
                  },
                  "Campaign name with invalid characters": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 111,
                      "response_message": "Invalid value: ^{",
                      "response_details": "Invalid name. A name must not contain any of the following values: ^{."
                    }
                  },
                  "Campaign name blank": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 108,
                      "response_message": "name value cannot be blank",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "Campaign name more than 255 characters": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 104,
                      "response_message": "Field: name cannot be more than 255 characters long",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid integration key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "example": {
                  "response_code": 7,
                  "response_message": "Invalid integration key",
                  "response_details": ""
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Unauthorized due to several potential reasons:\n- Account is inactive\n- Integration key is invalid or inactive\n- Account does not have SMS enabled\n- Subaccount is inactive or is not under the master account with integration key\n",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "SMS not enabled": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 16,
                      "response_message": "Invalid request. Account is not enabled with feature: SMS",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "Account not active": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 2,
                      "response_message": "Account id: 123 is not active",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "Invalid integration key": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 7,
                      "response_message": "Invalid integration key",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "X-Account-Id doesn't belong to account in IntegrationKey": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 6,
                      "response_message": "You are not authorized to make API request for account id: 456",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many requests",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorRateLimitExceeded"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal error while processing the request",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "example": {
                  "response_code": 119,
                  "response_message": "Cannot execute requested operation. Please refer to response_details for more information.",
                  "response_details": "Internal Error. Please retry."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "get": {
        "operationId": "smsv1campaign_getall",
        "tags": [
          "sms"
        ],
        "summary": "Get all SMS Campaign details with required values for an account (paginated)",
        "security": [
          {
            "IntegrationKey": []
          }
        ],
        "description": "Download basic information about each of the SMS campaigns in the specified account,  with the option to filter the campaigns returned in a variety of ways.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "status",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Return information for all SMS campaigns that are in one of the statuses included in the comma-separated list provided here (only).",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "Draft",
                "Incomplete",
                "Scheduled",
                "Sending",
                "Sent",
                "ScheduledRecurring",
                "PartiallySent",
                "ScheduledWorkflow",
                "Reserved"
              ]
            },
            "example": "Draft,Sent"
          },
          {
            "name": "isWorkflowCampaign",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Set this to true to only return workflow SMS campaigns.  Set this to false to return all non-workflow SMS campaigns.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "example": true
          },
          {
            "name": "filterOn",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Filter results by one of the following actions. When you include this parameter in the request, you must also specify the related time constraints using the OnOrBeforeUTC and/or the OnOrAfterUTC parameters.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "CreationDate",
                "LastModificationDate",
                "SendDate",
                "ScheduledDate"
              ]
            },
            "example": "SendDate"
          },
          {
            "name": "onOrBeforeUTC",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Return information for all SMS campaigns that were created, updated, sent or scheduled (per the action specified in the filterOn parameter) on or before this UTC date.  Date supplied must be formatted as follows: YYYY-MM-DD",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "2023-03-23"
          },
          {
            "name": "onOrAfterUTC",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Return information for all SMS campaigns that were created, updated, sent or scheduled (per the action specified in the filterOn parameter) on or after this UTC date. Date supplied must be formatted as follows: YYYY-MM-DD",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "2023-08-09"
          },
          {
            "name": "pageSize",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Return number of item per page.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32",
              "default": 10,
              "maximum": 1000
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "pageNumber",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Return data for specific page number.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 1,
              "format": "int32"
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XAccountId"
          }
        ],
        "x-codeSamples": [
          {
            "lang": "curl",
            "source": "curl -X GET \\\n  \"https://api.campaigner.com/sms/v1/campaign?status=Draft,Reserved&isWorkflowCampaign=false&filterOn=CreationDate&onOrBeforeUTC=2023-09-20\" \\\n  -H 'IntegrationKey: YOUR_API_KEY_HERE' \\\n  -H 'X-Account-Id: 123456'"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "If SMS campign Get is successful it returns OK",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GetAllSMSCampaignResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request due to several potential reasons:\n- status set to an invalid value\n- Account is Workflow feature disabled and isWorkflowCampaign passed\n- filterOn set to an invalid value\n- filterOn passed without onOrBeforeUTC and/or onOrAfterUTC\n- onOrBeforeUTC and/or onOrAfterUTC passed without filterOn\n- onOrBeforeUTC set to a date that is not in correct date format\n- onOrBeforeUTC set to a non-existing date/time\n- onOrBeforeUTC set to a value which is in the future\n- onOrAfterUTC set to a date that is not in correct date format\n- onOrAfterUTC set to a non-existing date/time\n- onOrAfterUTC set to a value which is in the future\n",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "onOrBeforeUTC set invalid date format": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 111,
                      "response_message": "Invalid value: 01-01-1934.",
                      "response_details": "'onOrBeforeUTC value should be a UTC value specified in format: YYYY-MM-DD'"
                    }
                  },
                  "onOrBeforeUTC set non-existing date": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 111,
                      "response_message": "Invalid value: 1934-09-31.",
                      "response_details": "'onOrBeforeUTC value is not a valid datetime value'"
                    }
                  },
                  "onOrAfterUTC set invalid date format": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 111,
                      "response_message": "Invalid value: 01-01-1934.",
                      "response_details": "'onOrAfterUTC value should be a UTC value specified in format: YYYY-MM-DD'"
                    }
                  },
                  "onOrAfterUTC set non-existing date": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 111,
                      "response_message": "Invalid value: 1934-09-31.",
                      "response_details": "'onOrAfterUTC value is not a valid datetime value'"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "If Integration Key is not supplied or if it doesn't match the account  (or master account) of the sms campaign to fetch tracked links.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError_InvalidIntegrationKey"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Unauthorized due to several potential reasons:\n- Account is inactive\n- Integration key is invalid or inactive\n- Account does not have a feature enabled\n- Subaccount is inactive or is not under the master account with integration key\n- Account is Sms feature disabled\n",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiError_FeatureDisabled"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many requests",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorRateLimitExceeded"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal error while processing the request",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "example": {
                  "response_code": 119,
                  "response_message": "Cannot execute requested operation. Please refer to response_details for more information.",
                  "response_details": "Internal Error. Please retry."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sms/v1/campaign/{id}": {
      "patch": {
        "operationId": "smsv1campaignid_patch",
        "tags": [
          "sms"
        ],
        "summary": "Update an SMS campaign",
        "description": "Update an SMS campaign.",
        "security": [
          {
            "IntegrationKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "The id of the SMS campaign that you want to update.",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32"
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XAccountId"
          }
        ],
        "x-codeSamples": [
          {
            "lang": "curl",
            "source": "curl -X PATCH \\\n  https://api.campaigner.com/sms/v1/campaign/12345 \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -H 'IntegrationKey: YOUR_API_KEY_HERE' \\\n  -H 'X-Account-Id: 123456' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"name\": \"SMS campaign name\",\n    \"isWorkflowCampaign\": false,\n    \"shortenURLs\": false,\n    \"trackAllLinkClicks\": false,\n    \"includeUnsubscribeMessage\": true,\n    \"contents\": {\n      \"contentSourceType\": \"Campaign or Custom\",\n      \"messageContent\": \"This is my SMS campaign.\",\n      \"campaignId\": 123\n    },\n    \"deliveryNotificationEmailAddresses\": [\n      \"email-1@example.com\",\n      \"email-2@example.com\"\n    ]\n  }'\n"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "Update SMS campaign request body format.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdateSmsCampaignModel"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "If updating the SMS campaign is successful, it returns No Content\n"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request due to several potential reasons:\n- Campaign name that already exists on the requested account\n- User supplies a campaign name having invalid characters\n- User supplies a blank campaign name\n- User supplies a campaign name having more than 255 characters\n- Request has invalid value, blank value or no value specified for contentSourceType\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and has no messageContent node specified\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and messageContent node specified with invalid value\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and messageContent node specified exceeding 4000 character limit\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and messageContent node specified has invalid characters\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Custom and messageContent node specified has invalid merge fields\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Campaign and has no campaignId node specified\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Campaign and campaignId node specified with blank/null value\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Campaign and campaignId node specified with invalid value (not existing SMS campaign or not an SMS campaign or does not belong to this account)\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to campaign and campaignId node specified with a valid value BUT the campaign contents contain invalid value (as per existing content checks performed on the UI)\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to Campaign and campaignId node specified has valid value BUT the campaign contents have invalid merge fields\n- If the API request has contents node specified, contentSourceType set to campaign and campaignId node specified with a valid value BUT the campaign contents contain invalid characters\n- The API will validate the email addresses supplied for their format, and will respond with an error in case the email address(s) supplied are not in valid format\n- API will respond with an error in case user provides more than 5 email addresses for delivery notification\n- If the API has a blank/null value specified for sendFrom field\n- If the API request has contents node specified without null/blank value set for it, but has no contentSourceType node specified \n- If account is not enabled with workflows feature and API has isworkflowcampaign parameter set to true\n",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "Campaign name already exists": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 102,
                      "response_message": "SMS Campaign 1 already exists",
                      "response_details": "Another SMS campaign with SMS Campaign 1 already exists on the account. Please specify another unique value for: name"
                    }
                  },
                  "Campaign name with invalid characters": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 111,
                      "response_message": "Invalid value: ^{",
                      "response_details": "Invalid name. A name must not contain any of the following values: ^{."
                    }
                  },
                  "Campaign name blank": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 108,
                      "response_message": "name value cannot be blank",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "Campaign name more than 255 characters": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 104,
                      "response_message": "Field: name cannot be more than 255 characters long",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid integration key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "example": {
                  "response_code": 7,
                  "response_message": "Invalid integration key",
                  "response_details": ""
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Unauthorized due to several potential reasons:\n- Account is inactive\n- Integration key is invalid or inactive\n- Account does not have SMS enabled\n- Subaccount is inactive or is not under the master account with integration key\n",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "SMS not enabled": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 16,
                      "response_message": "Invalid request. Account is not enabled with feature: SMS",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "Account not active": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 2,
                      "response_message": "Account id: 123 is not active",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "Invalid integration key": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 7,
                      "response_message": "Invalid integration key",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "X-Account-Id doesn't belong to account in IntegrationKey": {
                    "value": {
                      "response_code": 6,
                      "response_message": "You are not authorized to make API request for account id: 456",
                      "response_details": ""
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many requests",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorRateLimitExceeded"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal error while processing the request",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse_SmsCampaign"
                },
                "example": {
                  "response_code": 119,
                  "response_message": "Cannot execute requested operation. Please refer to response_details for more information.",
                  "response_details": "Internal Error. Please retry."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
